function renderInterviewOptions(){if(!currentUser)return;const branchSelect=$('#interviewBranch'),interviewerSelect=$('#interviewInterviewer'),filter=$('#interviewBranchFilter');if(!branchSelect||!interviewerSelect||!filter)return;const allowedBranches=access().scope==='all'?(activeBranchId==='all'?branches:branches.filter(b=>b.id===activeBranchId)):scopedBranches(),currentBranch=branchSelect.value;branchSelect.innerHTML=allowedBranches.map(b=>`<option value="${esc(b.id)}">${esc(b.name)}</option>`).join('');if(allowedBranches.some(b=>b.id===currentBranch))branchSelect.value=currentBranch;else branchSelect.value=(activeBranchId!=='all'&&allowedBranches.some(b=>b.id===activeBranchId)?activeBranchId:allowedBranches[0]?.id)||'';const interviewBranch=branchSelect.value,availableInterviewers=employees.filter(e=>e.status==='active'&&(!interviewBranch||e.branchId===interviewBranch));const currentInterviewer=interviewerSelect.value;interviewerSelect.innerHTML='<option value="">Belum ditentukan</option>'+availableInterviewers.map(e=>`<option value="${esc(e.id)}">${esc(e.name)} — ${esc(e.role)}</option>`).join('');interviewerSelect.value=availableInterviewers.some(e=>e.id===currentInterviewer)?currentInterviewer:'';const bs=scopedBranches(),cur=filter.value||'all';filter.innerHTML='<option value="all">Semua dalam cakupan</option>'+bs.map(b=>`<option value="${esc(b.id)}">${esc(b.name)}</option>`).join('');filter.value=[...bs.map(b=>b.id),'all'].includes(cur)?cur:'all';const fixed=access().scope!=='all'||activeBranchId!=='all';if(fixed){filter.value='all';filter.disabled=true}else filter.disabled=false;enhanceSelects();syncAllCustomSelects()}
function renderInterviews(){if(!viewAllowed('interview'))return;renderInterviewOptions();const q=$('#interviewSearch').value.trim().toLowerCase(),branch=$('#interviewBranchFilter').value,status=$('#interviewStatusFilter').value,data=scopedInterviews().filter(i=>{const searchable=[i.candidateName,i.position,i.email,i.phone,branchName(i.branchId),interviewerName(i.interviewerId),i.location,i.notes,interviewStatusLabel(i.status)];return(!q||searchable.some(x=>String(x||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)))&&(branch==='all'||i.branchId===branch)&&(status==='all'||i.status===status)}).sort((a,b)=>`${a.date||''} ${a.time||''}`.localeCompare(`${b.date||''} ${b.time||''}`));$('#interviewTableBody').innerHTML=data.map(i=>`<tr><td><div class="person-cell"><span class="employee-avatar">${initials(i.candidateName)}</span><div><strong>${esc(i.candidateName)}</strong><small>${esc(i.email||i.phone||'Kontak belum diisi')}</small></div></div></td><td><div class="stacked-cell"><strong>${esc(i.position||'—')}</strong><small>${esc(branchName(i.branchId))}</small></div></td><td><div class="stacked-cell"><strong>${fmtDate(i.date)} · ${esc(i.time||'—')}</strong><small>${esc(interviewMethodLabel(i.method))}${i.location?` · ${esc(i.location)}`:''}</small></div></td><td><div class="stacked-cell"><strong>${esc(interviewerName(i.interviewerId))}</strong><small>${esc(i.phone||'—')}</small></div></td><td><div class="stacked-cell interview-result-cell"><strong>${i.score==null?'Belum dinilai':`${Math.max(0,Math.min(100,Number(i.score)||0))}/100`}</strong><small title="${esc(i.notes||'')}">${esc(i.notes||'Belum ada catatan')}</small></div></td><td><span class="status-badge interview-${esc(i.status)}">${esc(interviewStatusLabel(i.status))}</span></td><td><div class="table-actions"><button class="icon-btn" data-edit-interview="${esc(i.id)}" title="Edit interview"><span data-icon="edit"></span></button><button class="icon-btn danger" data-delete-interview="${esc(i.id)}" title="Hapus interview"><span data-icon="trash"></span></button></div></td></tr>`).join('');$('#interviewEmpty').classList.toggle('hidden',data.length>0);const all=scopedInterviews();$('#interviewTotal').textContent=all.length;$('#interviewScheduled').textContent=all.filter(i=>i.status==='scheduled').length;$('#interviewDone').textContent=all.filter(i=>i.status==='interviewed').length;$('#interviewPassed').textContent=all.filter(i=>['passed','hired'].includes(i.status)).length;applyIcons($('#interviewTableBody'));$$('[data-edit-interview]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openInterview(b.dataset.editInterview));$$('[data-delete-interview]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>deleteInterview(b.dataset.deleteInterview))}
function openInterview(id=''){if(!requirePermission('interviewManage','Role Anda tidak dapat mengelola interview.'))return;const item=scopedInterviews().find(x=>x.id===id);if(id&&!item){toast('Interview di luar cakupan akses Anda.','error');return}$('#interviewModalTitle').textContent=item?'Edit Interview':'Tambah Interview';$('#interviewId').value=item?.id||'';$('#interviewCandidateName').value=item?.candidateName||'';$('#interviewPosition').value=item?.position||'';$('#interviewEmail').value=item?.email||'';$('#interviewPhone').value=item?.phone||'';renderInterviewOptions();const allowedBranches=access().scope==='all'?(activeBranchId==='all'?branches:branches.filter(b=>b.id===activeBranchId)):scopedBranches();$('#interviewBranch').value=item?.branchId||(activeBranchId!=='all'?activeBranchId:allowedBranches[0]?.id)||'';renderInterviewOptions();$('#interviewInterviewer').value=item?.interviewerId||'';$('#interviewDate').value=item?.date||todayISO();$('#interviewTime').value=item?.time||'09:00';$('#interviewMethod').value=item?.method||'onsite';$('#interviewLocation').value=item?.location||'';$('#interviewStatus').value=item?.status||'scheduled';$('#interviewScore').value=item?.score==null?'':item.score;$('#interviewNotes').value=item?.notes||'';syncAllCustomSelects();syncAllCustomDates();openModal('interviewModal')}
